  "notes": "Promote the style standard evidence check (npm run lint:check) from advisory to REQUIRED in requiredEvidenceCheckIds. Owner direction in-thread 2026-09-17, recorded in #2220: governance states lint is required; the readiness verdict now carries the style standard (a failing lint check reads as not-ready, including in standalone veritas:shadow runs). No double-enforcement inside ci:fast: the direct lint:check invariant fails the lane before readiness runs. Execution mapping remains enforced (nightly lane + verify:static:raw + workflow run block are the invokers).",
